- macro
- Hcurl
sobolev: H(curl)
polynomial-set: <k>[\nabla{{poly[k+1]}}\oplus\widetilde\kappa\left(\Sigma^{k+1,+}\cap\ker\nabla\cdot\right)@def@\Sigma^{k+1,+}@the modified velocity space defined in the cited Hu&ndash;Zhang&ndash;Zhang paper@@def@\widetilde\kappa@the corrected Poincar&eacute; curl operator defined in the cited paper@]
ndofs:
  tetrahedron:
    formula: 18+24k
entity-ndofs:
  vertices:
    formula: 3
  edges:
    formula: 4k+1
  faces:
    formula: 0
  volumes:
    formula: 0
dofs:
  vertices: point evaluations of curl components
  edges:
  - tangential integral moments with (lagrange,k)
  - (if \(k=1\)) point evaluations of curl components at edge midpoints
notes:
- The curl belongs to \(H^1\).
implementations:
